  m_Text: 'Guard turns blows from the front.


    A guard raised at the last instant is a perfect guard. It costs the enemy its balance.


    Red attacks cannot be guarded.


    Break an enemy''s balance, then finish it with a heavy blow.


    Embers are spent at rest fires.'
